  </section>

  <section class="zds-goal-grower">
    <div>
      <p class="zds-eyebrow">Goal Grower Support Collection</p>
      <h2>Help Goal Grower grow.</h2>
      <p>
        Goal Grower is still being built and tested. This collection helps fund app
        development, testing, design improvements, shared garden features, and App Store preparation.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="zds-support-grid">
      <a href="/pages/support">
        <span>01</span>
        <h3>Support Development</h3>
        <p>Help fund the continued building and testing of Goal Grower.</p>
      </a>

      <a href="/pages/beta">
        <span>02</span>
        <h3>Beta Tester Access</h3>
        <p>Help test features, shared gardens, bugs, and the app experience.</p>
      </a>

      <a href="/pages/goal-grower">
        <span>03</span>
        <h3>Goal Grower Updates</h3>
        <p>Follow progress as the app moves toward a public release.</p>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

